<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Darkness</h1>
<p>Sphere: Creation Sphere
Spell Tier: 1
Class: Necromancer (guild level 5), Dark Knight (guild level 12)
Mana: 20
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast darkness &lt;object&gt;
<a cmd='#'>cast darkness</a>   (on the room you are in)
</pre>
<p>The opposite of the light spell: an object, or the room you stand in, gives 
off less light for a while, as much less as a light spell would add. Cast it 
on something you carry, and the shadow goes where you go.
</p><p>The better your creation sphere, the longer it lasts: from a minute up to 
several minutes. It doesn't add up: something already darkened by the spell 
stays as it is. You must be standing. It is also found on staffs, scrolls and 
wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Continual Darkness</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Night Globe</a>
